    "labels": "LOLO: EXPLORATORY; held-out: DESCRIPTIVE",
    "multiplicity": "9 requests x 3 recipes x 2 budgets of per-request intervals; nothing is selected; the trigger scans 9 requests (T1) and 2 AUC contrasts (T2) of one recipe and budget",
    "v4_trigger": "the #112 v3 recipe (LC3) has an interference problem iff, at the per-request budget (the negative-transfer contrast: same updates of the request, with or without the other requests' updates), any of: T1 some request's joint / specialist t = 225 ratio has lower bound > 1.5; T2 the request-mean paired LOLO grid AUC joint - specialist, or that of the Gate-B unit F-15-macro, has upper bound < 0; T3 a joint member retires or skips more than 45 updates while no LC3 specialist or per-Delta member retires on the same request. If any fires, a v4 with a per-request mitigation named by the item-3 diagnosis is built under the #112 version policy and re-selected on LOLO; otherwise v3 stays the Gate-B recipe. The full budget is reported, not used by the trigger"
  },
